      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Let's simulate the calculation of fib(3)\n\nStarting with n = 3\n\nStep 1\nn = 2\nval = \ncontinue = afterfib-n-1\nn stack = 3\nval stack = \ncontinue stack = fib-done\n\nStep 2\nn = 1\nval = \ncontinue = afterfib-n-1\nn stack = 3, 2\nval stack = \ncontinue stack = fib-done, afterfib-n-1\n\nStep 3\nn = 0\nval = 1\ncontinue = afterfib-n-2\nn stack = 3\nval stack = 1\ncontinue stack = fib-done, afterfib-n-1\n\nStep 4\nn = 1\nval = 1\ncontinue =  afterfib-n-2\nn stack = 3\nval stack = 1\ncontinue stack = fib-done, fib-done\n\nStep 5\nn = 1\nval = 2\ncontinue = fib-done\nn stack = 3\nval stack = 1\ncontinue stack = fib-done",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 6,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Let's simulate the calculation of fib(3)\n\nStarting with n = 3\n\nStep 1\nn = 2\nval = \ncontinue = afterfib-n-1\nn stack = 3\nval stack = \ncontinue stack = fib-done\n\nStep 2\nn = 1\nval = \ncontinue = afterfib-n-1\nn stack = 3, 2\nval stack = \ncontinue stack = fib-done, afterfib-n-1\n\nStep 3\nn = 0\nval = 1\ncontinue = afterfib-n-2\nn stack = 3\nval stack = 1\ncontinue stack = fib-done, afterfib-n-1\n\nStep 4\nn = 1\nval = 1\ncontinue =  afterfib-n-2\nn stack = 3\nval stack = 1\ncontinue stack = fib-done, fib-done\n\nStep 5\nn = 1\nval = 2\ncontinue = fib-done\nn stack = 3\nval stack = 1\ncontinue stack = fib-done",
